15  0 32 (The instructions for using MODTRAN 3 are similar to those for the earlier LOWTRAN 7)W
1200 7380 m
15  0 32 (version.  However, some new parameters have been added, necessitating the addition of one new card,)W
1200 7056 m
15  0 32 (and minor modifications to two other cards. The new parameters \(appearing on required CARD 1A\),)W
1200 6732 m
15  0 32 (are principally required to govern: \(1\) a second multiple scattering option \(based on the multiple)W
1200 6408 m
15  0 32 (stream DISORT algorithm, after Stamnes et al. 1988\);  \(2\) a new high resolution solar irradiance)W
1200 6084 m
15  0 32 (\(based on a full calculated irradiance, after Kurucz 1995\) with an optional triangular smoothing)W
1200 5760 m
15  0 32 (function; and \(3\) a "one-step" update to the CO)W
